The '''Eccentric Painting Bundle''' is a {{Legendary}} item that can be purchased from the [[Dark Auction]]. It gives the player [[Eccentric Painting]]s.

== Obtaining ==
=== Dark Auction ===
The '''Eccentric Painting Bundle''' has a {{Green|4.87%}} chance to appear in round 1, 3 or 4 of the [[Dark Auction]] with a starting bid of {{c|20m}}.

=== Raffle of the Century ===
'''Eccentric Painting Bundle''' can also be obtained as a {{Gold|'''MEDIUM'''}} reward from [[Raffle of the Century]].
== Usage ==
The '''Eccentric Painting Bundle''' can be opened to give the player {{Item|Eccentric Painting|amount=9}}s.

